{"id":"perf_3ab72638e8c6a690","title":"上交室内乐1·上交弦乐队演绎尼尔森、伯恩斯坦与巴托克丨上海交响乐团音乐季","city":"上海","venue":"捷豹上海交响音乐厅","hall":"演艺厅","startTime":"2026-10-15T11:15:00.000Z","endTime":"2026-10-15T13:15:00.000Z","weekday":"周四","dateLabel":"10/15","timeLabel":"19:15","price":"¥120 - ¥220","priceTiers":[120,220],"description":"本乐季上交室内乐第1场由驻团指挥孙一凡指挥，携乐队首席柳鸣，带领上交弦乐队带来一场跨地域的音乐语言对话。尼尔森抒情优美的《弦乐小组曲》、伯恩斯坦为小提琴和弦乐队而作的《西区故事》组曲，以及巴托克的《嬉游曲》，让北欧、百老汇与中欧的音乐语言在同一舞台相遇，充分展现弦乐合奏丰富的音响层次。","status":"scheduled","ticketUrl":"https://shsymphony.cn/symphonypc/index.html#/zh-CN/pc/musicale-detail?id=21804&supportSeat=Y","sourceName":"上海交响乐团官网","sourceUrl":"https://shsymphony.cn/symphonypc/index.html#/zh-CN/pc/musicale-detail?id=21804&supportSeat=Y","scrapedAt":"2026-08-17T13:00:34.458Z","ensemble":"伯恩斯坦与巴托克丨上海交响乐团","conductor":"孙一凡","performers":["孙一凡","柳鸣","李学鸿","马谦艺","于任超","徐堉杰","严多加","周燕妮","陆逸帆","曹亦博","孙泽昊","王柏淳","陈少俊","赵长宏","赵丽媛","郑舒颐","伯恩斯坦"],"composers":["尼尔森","伯恩斯坦","巴托克"],"program":[{"composer":"尼尔森","title":"弦乐小组曲，作品1","confidence":"official","id":"program_6bb4810ff8acfcbc","workId":"work_06ca164f8608174f"},{"composer":"伯恩斯坦","title":"为小提琴和弦乐队而作的《西区故事》组曲（保罗·贝特曼改编）","confidence":"official","id":"program_64568b384667ea73","workId":"work_c61f88d8dd1877a0"},{"composer":"巴托克","title":"嬉游曲，Sz. 113","confidence":"official","id":"program_4967dd41396f3fa9","workId":"work_e4d5979f8fc8db8c"}],"tags":["尼尔森","伯恩斯坦","巴托克","交响","室内乐"],"dataQuality":"scraped","projectId":"event_a223e6e782039c8e","sources":[{"sourceId":"shsymphony-official","sourceName":"上海交响乐团官网","sourceRecordId":"shsymphony_21804","sourceUrl":"https://shsymphony.cn/symphonypc/index.html#/zh-CN/pc/musicale-detail?id=21804&supportSeat=Y","ticketUrl":"https://shsymphony.cn/symphonypc/index.html#/zh-CN/pc/musicale-detail?id=21804&supportSeat=Y","scrapedAt":"2026-08-17T13:00:34.458Z"}]}